{"title":"올 타임 하이 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"코인 사기로 날린 7천만 원. 남은 건 한강 다리 위에서의 미련과 단돈 500만 원뿐.죽으려다 마음 고쳐먹고 들어온 주식 판에서, 신희수는 제 인생을 설계하려는 남자 ‘에어라인’을 만난다.“야, 똥개. 가서 저 사기꾼 강의 듣고 보고해. 넌 돈이 급하고, 난 복수가 급하거든.”시골 똥개 취급하며 굴릴 땐 언제고, 차트 분석할 때만은 눈이 번뜩이는 희수에게 에어라인의 심장이 먼저 상한가를 치기 시작한다.주가 흐름은 읽어도 제 마음은 읽지 못하는, 두 ‘돈미새’들의 처절하고도 달콤한 풀베팅 로맨스!#주식물 #돈미새공수 #잘생쁨공 #예민공 #입덕부정공 #귀염수 #싹싹수 #자학개그수 #눈치없수","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":267,"change":{"type":"down","amount":228}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":50,"change":{"type":"up","amount":217}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":36,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":41,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":36,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":34,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":25,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":18,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":142,"change":{"type":"down","amount":124}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":23,"change":{"type":"up","amount":119}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":23,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":18,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":21,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":28,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":44,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":39,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":44,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":42,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":35,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":34,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":33,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":123,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":47,"change":{"type":"up","amount":76}},{"date":"